{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米受迫害"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["音麦的儿子巴施户珥祭司在耶和华的殿中做总管。他听见耶利米预言这些事，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["便叫人殴打耶利米先知，用枷锁把他锁在耶和华殿的便雅悯上门处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["第二天，他打开枷锁释放了耶利米，耶利米对他说：“耶和华不再叫你巴施户珥，要叫你玛歌珥·米撒毕",{"noteId":6},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因为耶和华说，‘我要使你和你的朋友都惊慌失措，让你亲眼看见你的朋友死在敌人刀下。我要把犹大人都交在巴比伦王手中，使他们或被掳到巴比伦或死于刀下。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我要把这城里所有的财富、出产、珍宝，甚至犹大列王的宝物都交给敌人，带到巴比伦作战利品。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你巴施户珥和你所有的家人，以及听你说假预言的朋友都要被掳到巴比伦，死在那里，葬在那里。’”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米的抱怨"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你欺骗我，我被你骗了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你制服我，胜过我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今，我终日被嘲笑，人人戏弄我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我每次说预言，都大声疾呼：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“暴力和毁灭要来了！”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因传讲耶和华的话而终日遭受侮辱和讥笑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有时我打算不再提起耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再奉祂的名宣讲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但祂的话如一团火在我心中燃烧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憋在我骨头里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我无法隐忍，不得不说。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我听见许多人窃窃私语，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恐怖四下弥漫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说：“我们告发他！告发他！”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的好友都盼着我灭亡，说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“或许他会受骗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那样我们便能打倒他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一泄心头之恨。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和华与我同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂像勇猛的战士。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以迫害我的人必一败涂地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们因失败而羞愧难当，留下永远的耻辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"考验义人、洞悉人心的万军之耶和华啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你让我看见你报应他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我已向你禀明案情。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"你们要歌颂耶和华！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要赞美耶和华！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂从恶人手中救出穷人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"愿我出生的那天受咒诅！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿我母亲生我的那天不蒙祝福！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿那告诉我父亲喜得贵子、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他欢喜的人受咒诅！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿那人像被耶和华无情毁灭的城！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他早晨听见哀鸣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"中午听见战争的呐喊，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他没有把我杀死在母腹中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有使母腹成为我的坟墓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让我永远留在里面。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么我要从母胎出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"经历患难和痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在羞辱中度过一生呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"“玛歌珥·米撒毕”意思是“四面有恐怖”。","reference":{"chapter":20,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}